# Cisco Packet Tracer Enterprise Network Security

## Overview

Designed and implemented an enterprise network security solution using Cisco Packet Tracer.

The project demonstrates firewall implementation, NAT, DMZ configuration, VPN deployment, Access Control Lists (ACLs), network segmentation, and enterprise security validation within a simulated business environment.

